1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,400
FEMALE TEXT-TO-SPEECH VOICE:
Top of the morning to you.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,570
You've reached Maggie McGarry.

3
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:09,940
(Mechanical voice on Sheldon's phone:)Leave a message
after the wee little beep.

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,340
(Sheldon:)It's pretty convincing, huh?

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,610
That wasn't even
a real person.

6
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,860
(Sheldon:)And here is
the clincher:

7
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:21,520
(Sheldon:)a lock of Maggie's
flaming auburn hair.

8
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:22,790
Where'd you get that?

9
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:25,590
(Sheldon:)From an orangutan
in the primate lab.

10
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,690
(Leonard:)An orangutan?

11
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:27,570
Well, no one's going

12
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,790
(Sheldon:)to run a DNA test
on it, Leonard.

13
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,860
(Sheldon:)Honestly, you overthink
everything.

14
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:35,170
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I don't need an alibi.

15
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,930
(Leonard:)Nobody's going to ask
about last night

16
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:39,370
(Leonard:)as long as you just
zip your lip.

17
00:00:42,670 --> 00:00:43,970
Thank you.

18
00:00:43,980 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)Now, don't worry,
everything is going to be fine.

